<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>三处被实验推翻的原判断</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F2' }}>15 · Corrections</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 54 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            以下三条均为实验前确信、实验后被否定的判断，已全部写入报告与踩坑清单，并在正文中改写为带边界条件的形式。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', width: 52 }}>Ⅰ</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: 300 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>完全去掉池化</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>依据笔记 C3：池化会丢失小结节</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', width: 430, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>实测 0.9845 → 0.9782，反而更低。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', width: 336, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>改为：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>不堆叠池化，但保留一次 2×2</span>。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', width: 52 }}>Ⅱ</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: 300 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>增强越多越好</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>翻转之外再加 10° 旋转</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', width: 430, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>实测 0.9851 → 0.9821，旋转把肺野推出画布并引入黑边填充。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', width: 336, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>改为：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>只保留水平翻转</span>，增强需保持标签语义。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', width: 52 }}>Ⅲ</Text>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: 300 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>ViT 结构更优</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>依据 0.9935 高于 0.9886</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', width: 430, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>参数量对齐后 ViT 0.9935 对 MLP 0.9922，差值落入种子波动。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', width: 336, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>改为：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>ViT 不劣于 MLP</span>，优势来自全局混合而非注意力。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                修正后的结论覆盖范围更窄，但每一条都能被 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>results/ 下的 CSV</span> 复核；这比保留原来的强判断更有价值。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>MedMNIST 医学影像分类调参实验室 · 中期验收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>15 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
